{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年7月28日 21:43 星期二</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>天文台表示，香港以南持續有雨帶發展並向北移動，預料未來一兩小時本港雨勢有時頗大及有狂風。（天文台）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T13:59:09.162419+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none"}}